</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Brisse</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>The systematics of trypanosomes of medical and veterinary importance.</article-title><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Maudlin</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Holmes</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Miles</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Trypanosomiases</source><publisher-loc>Wallingford, UK</publisher-loc><publisher-name>CABI Publishing</publisher-name><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>23</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000347-Xong1"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Xong</surname><given-names>HV</given-names></name><name><surname>Vanhamme</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Chamekh</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Chimfwembe</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Den Abbeele</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1998</year><article-title>A VSG expression site-associated gene confers resistance to human serum in Trypanosoma rhodesiense.</article-title><source>Cell</source><volume>95</volume><fpage>839</fpage><lpage>846</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9865701</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000347-Agur1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Agur</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Abiri</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Van der Ploeg</surname><given-names>LH</given-names></name></person-group><year>1986</year><article-title>Ordered appearance of antigenic variants of African trypanosomes explained in a mathematical model based on a stochastic switch process and immune-selection against putative switc